cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OOES-18, please cite this repository and the companion DS-PR412 paper."
title: "OOES-18: An Open Deterministic Evidence Schema for EU Regulation 2024/3015 and French DELTA IE (H1) Pre-Clearance"
abstract: "OOES-18 is an open, deterministic evidence schema for cross-border manufacturing orders. It defines 18 evidentiary slots across five layers, a three-valued epistemic lattice, two deterministic release gates, Ed25519 attestation signatures with a relying-party trust store, and a salted blind-index protocol for cross-tenant duplicate-pledge detection. The repository contains the specification, JSON Schema, deterministic test vector, TypeScript reference verifier, and test suite."
